        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-slate-300 mb-12 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
          {city} properties face {localRisk}. Insurance companies minimize payouts across {county}. Claim Guardians forces your insurer to pay the full cost of your property repairs.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 mb-14">
          <a href="/free-claim-review" class="btn-accent px-10 py-5 text-lg min-h-[60px]">Free {city} Property Inspection</a>
          <a href="tel:3058045489" class="inline-flex justify-center items-center px-10 py-5 text-lg font-bold text-white bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md border-2 border-white/20 rounded-xl hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 min-h-[60px]">Call a Local Expert</a>
