          <div class="step-number mx-auto">1</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#082142] mt-6 mb-3">Free Inspection</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500">We dispatch a {stateName}-licensed adjuster to your {city} property within 24 hours to document all damage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="step-number mx-auto">2</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#082142] mt-6 mb-3">Full Documentation</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500">We photograph, measure, and estimate every point of damage using thermal imaging, drones, and contractor pricing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="step-number mx-auto">3</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#082142] mt-6 mb-3">Claim & Negotiation</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500">We file your claim with a detailed scope of loss and negotiate directly with your insurer on your behalf.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="step-number mx-auto">4</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#082142] mt-6 mb-3">Maximum Settlement</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500">We force your insurer to pay the true cost of repairs. If they refuse, we escalate through appraisal or legal channels.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

